entries.description:
Expense Ledger, built twice: Twin A in Python/Flask and Twin B in Node.js/Express show the same screens, workflows and outputs, proved by a parity check (218/218 responses byte-identical), 15/15 pixel-identical screens and 82 passing tests, with all 18 requirements traced to both codebases; deep ink, ledger green and mint, set in Geist and Geist Mono. On award you receive both runnable projects with commented source, a README each (setup, dependencies, tests), the requirements write-up with traceability matrix (PDF and Markdown), the shared spec and test scenarios, the parity and screenshot tools, and PNG/PDF previews; the attached PDF is the full 15-page document. Unlimited revisions: any change (colour, font, layout, text) delivered within a few hours, rate or comment and I will revise.
